  "_readme": "One entry per map pin. Pin status (held vs upcoming) is derived at runtime from the latest event end date. col/row are computed from lat/lon; use nudge to shift a pin by whole grid cells, and labelSide \"left\" to put the label on the left of the pin. Pins with an empty events list are earlier 2026 events with no details recorded (shown as held). country must match a name in src/countryLookup.js; add it to countryColors to light it up (a country too small to own grid cells, like Singapore, lights the land cells around its pins). Virtual events have no location, so they live in virtualEvents and get no pin.",
